{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-verdes-by-haven","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"verdes-by-haven-aldar-properties-dubailand-residence-complex","about":"Verdes by Haven is a premium residential complex from the developer Aldar Properties, which is recognized as one of the most reliable in the UAE, focused on health care and comfort in every home. The complex offers luxury apartments with 1, 2 and 3 bedrooms, decorated in dark and light finishes using natural shades. The first thing you notice when entering the community is the iconic Tree House. The complex is built around a beautiful tree and features a spacious multi-level communal lounge. Perfect for a productive morning in the coworking space or a casual evening with family and friends.Residents of Verdes by Haven will enjoy a variety of amenities, from an infinity pool, park, playgrounds to luxurious co-working spaces, state-of-the-art gyms and spa rooms. It is also important to have an optimized HVAC system, a smart waste management system, and energy- and water-saving mechanisms to reduce utility bills and promote a more environmentally friendly lifestyle.The complex is located in Dubai's first health district - Dubailand - just 25 minutes from the center of Dubai. Approximately 30 minutes' drive from the stunning and popular Dubai Marina, 10 minutes from the vibrant Global Village, 25 minutes from the city center and the iconic Burj Khalifa, and the rest of the world via Dubai International Airport.","price":990000,"title":"Verdes by Haven","bitrix":{"id":681,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Verdes by Haven","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Verdes by Haven","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Dubailand"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Verdes_by_Haven_by_Aldar_Properties_in_Dubailand_Residence_Complex_For_Sale_1f14fc070